/5.2 (0.025x) and Claude Opus 5.5 / Sonnet 5.5 (0.05x). ANTHROPIC cache_min: 512 for Fable 5.x, Opus 5/5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Haiku 5.5; 1024 for Opus 4.8, Sonnet 5/4.6/4.5, Opus 4.1; 2048 for Opus 4.7; 4096 for Opus 4.6/4.5 and Haiku 4.5. OpenAI auto-caches at >=1024 tokens (assumed for gpt-6). Google implicit min: 4096 for every 3.x and 4, 2048 for 2.5 Pro/Flash, 1024 for 2.5 Flash-Lite. Tiers of new models are judgment calls by price and the provider's own positioning. Not listed: Claude Mythos (limited access, priced as Fable), OpenAI *-pro models. Unknown models fall back to a default price in code (identity preserved, flagged model_known=false).",
